{"id":"f13740fe3d0acf2e","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-hyperarithmetical.md","title":"Hyperarithmetical","display":"df-hyperarithmetical — Hyperarithmetical","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-hyperarithmetical","aliases":["92-df-hyperarithmetical"],"display":"df-hyperarithmetical — Hyperarithmetical","depends_on":["[[92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-hyperarithmetical"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-hyperarithmetical</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hyperarithmetical — Hyperarithmetical"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"19c8b0267ad22ce9\" href=\"?note=19c8b0267ad22ce9\" title=\"92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy\">92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span> (set of natural numbers)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_K\">\\(\\mathcal O_K\\)</span> (recursive-ordinal notation system, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"19c8b0267ad22ce9\" href=\"?note=19c8b0267ad22ce9\" title=\"92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy\">92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(H_a)_{a\\in\\mathcal O_K}\">\\((H_a)_{a\\in\\mathcal O_K}\\)</span> (effective transfinite jump hierarchy from the same source)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Hyperarith}\">\\(\\mathrm{Hyperarith}\\)</span> (definition-target predicate)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Hyperarith}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O_K\\;\\bigl(A\\leq_T H_a\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Hyperarith}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O_K\\;\\bigl(A\\leq_T H_a\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>超算术：迭代Turing跳跃</li>\n<li>沿递归序数的有效记号迭代，且极限层必须取此前各层的有效直和；只写未定义的<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{JumpIter}(\\emptyset,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{JumpIter}(\\emptyset,\\alpha)\\)</span>不足以确定极限层</li>\n<li>超算术类包含全部算术集合，并严格包含该类（存在超出每个有限算术层级的超算术集合）</li>\n<li>真算术的句子码集与有限跳跃的有效直和<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0^{(\\omega)}\">\\(0^{(\\omega)}\\)</span> Turing等价，因而是超算术的；这不表示它属于某个有限算术层级</li>\n<li>与不完备性层级对应</li>\n<li>Kleene型记号系统<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal O_K\">\\(\\mathcal O_K\\)</span>编码递归序数；记号集合自身的复杂度不要与每个<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_a\">\\(H_a\\)</span>的超算术性混淆</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19c8b0267ad22ce9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy","status":"resolved","id":"19c8b0267ad22ce9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal O_K$ (recursive-ordinal notation system, see [[92-df-kleene-o-jump-hierarchy]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_K","display":false},{"tex":"(H_a)_{a\\in\\mathcal O_K}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Hyperarith}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hyperarithmetical} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{Hyperarith}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists a\\in\\mathcal O_K\\;\\bigl(A\\leq_T H_a\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{JumpIter}(\\emptyset,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"0^{(\\omega)}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal O_K","display":false},{"tex":"H_a","display":false}],"bytes":1438,"backlinks":[{"id":"275a460122ba5530","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"911d25a82b6a7593","anchor":"ref-58","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-hyperarithmetical]]"},{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-63","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-df-1-consistency.md]]\n[[92-df-analytical-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetic-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetical-truth.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-property.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization-steps.md]]\n[[92-df-arithmetization.md]]\n[[92-df-assignment.md]]\n[[92-df-atomic-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-check.md]]\n[[92-df-axiom-set.md]]\n[[92-df-axiomatization.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-arithmetic.md]]\n[[92-df-bounded-quantifier.md]]\n[[92-df-ce-set.md]]\n[[92-df-church-turing-thesis.md]]\n[[92-df-closed-term.md]]\n[[92-df-complete-system.md]]\n[[92-df-composition.md]]\n[[92-df-concept-network-complete.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-hierarchy.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-statement.md]]\n[[92-df-consistency-strength.md]]\n[[92-df-consistent.md]]\n[[92-df-constructible-universe.md]]\n[[92-df-continuum-hypothesis.md]]\n[[92-df-contradiction.md]]\n[[92-df-creative-set.md]]\n[[92-df-decidable-set.md]]\n[[92-df-definability.md]]\n[[92-df-delta0-formula.md]]\n[[92-df-diagonal-function.md]]\n[[92-df-elementary-system.md]]\n[[92-df-encoding-completeness.md]]\n[[92-df-enumerable.md]]\n[[92-df-expressible.md]]\n[[92-df-expression.md]]\n[[92-df-extension-theory.md]]\n[[92-df-feasible-mathematics.md